  "title": "Rota's unimodal conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $M$ be a matroid of rank $r$, and for $0 \\le i \\le r$ let $w_i$ be the number of closed sets of rank $i$.\n\nConjecture $w_0,w_1,\\ldots,w_r$ is unimodal.\n\nConjecture $w_0,w_1,\\ldots,w_r$ is log-concave.",
